{%- comment -%}
  Price display in shekels: ₪249 (no trailing .00), ₪99.90 keeps the agorot.
  Independent of the store's money format setting (which is "{{amount}} NIS").
  Usage: {% render 'money', cents: product.price %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign amount = cents | money_without_currency | remove: '.00' -%}
<span class="money" dir="ltr">₪{{ amount }}</span>
